Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:17.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, eat a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:20.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eat and get your strength back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:22.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine! Suit yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:25.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come I have to \Ntake care of this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, does it still hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:29.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should I get some medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:40.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's his condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.35,0:00:42.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He won't listen to \Nwhat we tell him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:45.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We helped him out before, and then he ran off!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:53.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who carry Ishbalan blood \Nare protected by our god, Ishbala.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.11,0:00:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything has happened by God's direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:14.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? \NAren't you going at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.60,0:01:16.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the reason \Nyou hired me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:23.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to cut through their flesh \Nand splatter their blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.90,0:01:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it, kill them! \NLeave no one alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.48,0:01:54.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is God bestowing upon us \Nyet another trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is not the will of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:02.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the karmic doing of despicable men!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:06.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mustn't! \NNot in your condition!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:14.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:19.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:24.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:07.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:12.37,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Earlier in Resembool, there was something you were about to tell me, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.37,0:04:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something you were too afraid to say to me till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:19.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was that my soul and \Nmemories and everything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are really something fake that you came up with, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:25.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! What Ed wanted \Nto say to you was—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that all you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:34.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you, Brother?! Answer my question!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(3090,3570,\1c&HEEEEEB&,\3c&HEEEEEB&,\4c&HEEEEEB&)}Why don't you say anything?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, why didn't you answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:52.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I'm nothing more than memories that Brother made up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:57.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:04:59.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. And then I told her...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.65,0:05:10.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My memories of being with Mom could be fake too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:16.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop! Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:21.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sneaky thieves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:22.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:24.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:36.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:38.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:42.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want any! Stealing things from a store out of the blue—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:44.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if Mom knew we were doing this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:47.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.79,0:05:49.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it easy on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't steal other people's things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:55.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? This pile of junk spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:56.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:05:59.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not a pile of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.21,0:06:04.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By any chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.01,0:06:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are you guys from Ishbal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:12.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:14.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you seen anyone like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:17.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope, I don't know \Nanything about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:19.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:25.46,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Ed, in any event, we have to find Al and \Ntalk things over thoroughly with him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:26.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:29.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:33.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to ask Al \Nsomething for so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:37.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid to \Ntalk to him about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:39.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:42.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(2400,2940,\1c&HFFFFFF&,\3c&HFFFFFF&,\4c&HFFFFFF&)}He... for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:49.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:53.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think there are things you have to talk about, or you'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:19.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must think it unusual that \Nwe'd be living in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:23.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all. I'm the one who \Nfollowed along on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, I hear you looked after these children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:31.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, you have \Na most peculiar outfit on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:35.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can relax. \NHe is not a military person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:37.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We meet again,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:41.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.37,0:07:44.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that \Nyou're here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:53.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:55.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:07:57.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:08:00.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, this works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:05.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Visitor, I'd like for you \Nnot to tell anyone about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:07.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:10.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know about Ishbal myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.74,0:08:13.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why has it come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The military folks \Ncame and attacked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:18.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:23.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the past, they used every means \Nthey got their hands on to slaughter us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.53,0:08:25.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But apparently, it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.64,0:08:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I despise all State Alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.35,0:08:32.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they're going to kill me, \Nthere's no better time than now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:35.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:37.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:41.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens to Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:48.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:51.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gone! Mom's locket!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:54.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? That doesn't make any difference, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:55.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:08:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's when I lost it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.05,0:09:04.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See here! You cannot go outside again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick! Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:08.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.35,0:09:16.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse Elric, \NI don't know what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:19.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if you and your brother hate each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then it works out well for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:24.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.37,0:09:27.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what do you think about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After talking to me, do you... do you sense anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:34.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean about me! In this body, do you think I'm human?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:52.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it. Ishbalans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:57.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick, give up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:08.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this what you were looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.75,0:10:12.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.87,0:10:14.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.09,0:10:20.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Continue tailing them and locate their nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.19,0:10:27.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, it's a memento \Nof your late mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.26,0:10:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:30.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's inside of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:33.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know. It won't open. But that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:35.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get rid of that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:40.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't talk that way \Nabout your mother's keepsake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:43.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That woman... \NYou call her a mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:45.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All she ever did was force religious precepts on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:48.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was never once kind to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:51.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was just thinking of what was best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:55.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! She didn't care \Nwhat happened to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:11.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does this boy want to forget his entire past?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.58,0:11:14.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the complete opposite of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.69,0:11:21.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to get my memories back. \NMy real memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:29.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:31.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.43,0:11:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:47.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.99,0:11:58.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:03.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.99,0:12:18.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.27,0:12:22.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.31,0:12:24.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Al-kun! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:26.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you about to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:30.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So they're mercenaries, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:33.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're using a military installation on the outskirts of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:35.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick should be there as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.55,0:12:40.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still, Scar-san, are you sure \Nthis is all right? We're about to go fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:44.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Do you have a problem with us \Ngoing together with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:45.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The people of Ishbal value \Nblood relations more than anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:55.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it means saving Rick, then they can have the life of this old fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:57.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.56,0:13:01.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is something important to the people of Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,our mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.27,0:13:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,abandoned us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:11.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A phone call from Al?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:14.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. It sounded like he'd stuck \Nhis nose into something strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:19.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On that horrendous day for Ishbal...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.79,0:13:24.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom was offering up prayers to Ishbala, \Njust like she always did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:33.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rick...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:07.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:11.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was no need for Rick to know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:15.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would protect Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:19.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:27.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll get a load of reward money from the military for this job!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to take it easy for a while, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:36.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got one of the kids, just like we were told.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we be sure \Nthe group will be coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:41.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know it. \NThese folks are tightly united.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.25,0:14:46.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as we can lure out \Nthe armored guy and the scarred man...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.19,0:14:59.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An alchemist, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.23,0:15:00.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.34,0:15:09.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And there's the scarred man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.41,0:15:13.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys take the armored guy. \NI'll take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:16.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.65,0:15:20.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We meet again, Little Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:22.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:29.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go pulling out all the stops. \NAfter all, you don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:32.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just created memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll put you out of your misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you won't \Nhave to worry anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.41,0:15:42.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,about whether or not \Nyour memories are real!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:15:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:15:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Al?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:03.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's obvious! We were worried sick \Nand came looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:06.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:10.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:19.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al! I've been too afraid \Nto ask you for too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.51,0:16:26.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you blame me?! It's my fault that you wound up in that body!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:28.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:32.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why... That's why I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.60,0:16:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:37.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you blamed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:40.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother... That's what \Nyou wanted to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:42.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother... How could I... How could I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:52.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,blame you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:19.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:30.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:36.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, even that fabled man can fail to kill someone when he's in enough pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shoot him! Somebody get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:46.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give up. \NYou're the only one left now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:47.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:50.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same as you, \Na dog of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.89,0:17:54.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A dog of the military? \NYou're a State Alchemist?! Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:57.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:59.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a State Alchemist, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.63,0:18:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For putting me in this body, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.28,0:18:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fool! Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:35.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:37.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:49.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick! Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.06,0:18:55.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.63,0:19:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:14.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is eye medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:20.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your mother's eyes \Nmust have been ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.58,0:19:25.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she didn't want to worry you, \Nso she pretended that she could still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:31.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she said she wasn't able to do enough for her children because of her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:35.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But on the inside, it must have been considerably harder for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:38.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She couldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:39.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.09,0:19:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leo! Rick! Leo! Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.03,0:19:57.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom couldn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:19:59.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was looking for us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:01.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and went into the children's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:03.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:15.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?! \NI thought I was hired by the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.05,0:20:19.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So why was there a State Alchemist getting in our way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:21.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.67,0:20:24.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you say something—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:36.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.21,0:20:41.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are others who make their way \Nwhile avoiding pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.18,0:20:44.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think we shall go visit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, thanks for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:50.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'm going to go on living, holding memories of my mother dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:51.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:55.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, too, am going to hold my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.43,0:20:58.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really... hold them as real memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:21:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse Elric...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:02.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.56,0:21:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw something in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.85,0:21:07.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The tears that you couldn't see in your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:11.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.47,0:21:14.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.66,0:21:18.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar! Tell me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:22.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you, the people of Ishbala, have a Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.53,0:21:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which the military was after?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:25.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.94,0:21:27.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We sought a Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:31.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to protect ourselves from being destroyed by the military that was after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.48,0:21:34.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So did you make one? \NA Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.37,0:21:38.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get us underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:41.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.59,0:21:43.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:46.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those people need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:21:59.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, shall we get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:01.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.06,0:22:07.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, we always argued over the dumbest things, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.51,0:22:10.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, like who had top or bottom of the bunk beds, and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.96,0:22:13.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I lost that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.17,0:22:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when we fought over toys, I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.75,0:22:18.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We fought over candy too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:22.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I never did win.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.72,0:23:40.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.52,0:23:43.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 25: "Words of Farewell"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.52,0:23:46.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll leave without telling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.74,0:23:49.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what we've always done.
